{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "fr",
  "language_raw": "French",
  "source": "message/dat/French/script/class_e_05.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/class_e_05.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_01",
      "hash64": "5EED0D6A18CAE4A4",
      "text": "Yo ! Rien de tel qu’un cours de combat Pokémon\\npour se mettre en jambes, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_02",
      "hash64": "5EED106A18CAE9BD",
      "text": "Vous avez tout donné lors du contrôle partiel,\\nje suis fière de vous ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_03",
      "hash64": "5EED0F6A18CAE80A",
      "text": "Continuez comme ça pendant le second round.\\nJe parle de la seconde partie du programme ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_04",
      "hash64": "5EED0A6A18CADF8B",
      "text": "Est-ce que vous avez toutes et tous eu l’occasion\\nde tester la formule « Bouton R, en avant ! » ?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_05",
      "hash64": "5EED096A18CADDD8",
      "text": "Cette phrase est très pratique ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_06",
      "hash64": "5EED0C6A18CAE2F1",
      "text": "Vous pouvez l’utiliser pour que votre Pokémon\\naille ramasser des objets éloignés ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_07",
      "hash64": "5EED0B6A18CAE13E",
      "text": "En présence d’un Pokémon sauvage, cette phrase\\ndéclenchera un combat.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_08",
      "hash64": "5EED066A18CAD8BF",
      "text": "On parlera alors de « combat auto ».[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_09",
      "hash64": "5EED056A18CAD70C",
      "text": "Lors de ces combats, les Pokémon se battent\\nde façon autonome, sans que vous ayez besoin\\r\\nde leur dire quoi faire.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_10",
      "hash64": "5EEA086A18C8A64E",
      "text": "Et, en cas de victoire, ils remporteront des Points\\nd’Expérience, comme lors d’un combat ordinaire.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_11",
      "hash64": "5EEA096A18C8A801",
      "text": "C’est donc une méthode très efficace pour\\nentraîner ses Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_12",
      "hash64": "5EEA066A18C8A2E8",
      "text": "Cependant, les Pokémon qui montent de niveau\\nlors d’un combat auto ne pourront ni apprendre\\r\\nde nouvelles capacités ni évoluer.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_13",
      "hash64": "5EEA076A18C8A49B",
      "text": "Ensuite, si un Pokémon perd un combat auto,\\nil ne lui restera qu’un petit nombre de PV,\\r\\nalors pensez bien à le soigner tout de suite.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_14",
      "hash64": "5EEA0C6A18C8AD1A",
      "text": "Je me rends compte que j’ai parlé d’une traite...\\nEst-ce que vous avez des questions ?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_e_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "8C797B09D4DE44AA",
      "text": "Comment sortir du mode combat auto ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_e_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "8C797A09D4DE42F7",
      "text": "Qu’en est-il de la capture en combat auto ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_e_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "8C797909D4DE4144",
      "text": "Non, pas de question !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_answer_01",
      "hash64": "476C1EE7B64FE445",
      "text": "Une fois que le combat a commencé, il est\\nimpossible de sortir du mode combat auto.\\c\\nToutefois, vous pouvez rappeler votre Pokémon\\navant qu’il ne se lance dans un combat en\\r\\nappuyant sur le bouton ZR pendant qu’il\\r\\nse déplace ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 174,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 217,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 233,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_answer_02",
      "hash64": "476C1BE7B64FDF2C",
      "text": "Lors d’un combat auto, votre Pokémon se battra\\njusqu’à ce que l’adversaire soit K.O.\\c\\nSi vous souhaitez attraper ce dernier, vous devrez\\nreprendre la main.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 157,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_answer_03",
      "hash64": "476C1CE7B64FE0DF",
      "text": "Eh bien, vous m’impressionnez ! Je suis sûre que\\nvous irez loin.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_15",
      "hash64": "5EEA0D6A18C8AECD",
      "text": "N’oubliez pas : pour un Pokémon, un combat\\nauto est exactement comme un combat normal.\\r\\nIl se battra et fera de son mieux pour vous ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_16",
      "hash64": "5EEA0A6A18C8A9B4",
      "text": "Surveillez-le, et s’il est en difficulté, retirez-le\\ndu combat avant qu’il ne perde.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_17",
      "hash64": "5EEA0B6A18C8AB67",
      "text": "Il va de soi que les Pokémon qui ont peu de PV\\nne sont pas en grande forme.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_18",
      "hash64": "5EEA006A18C898B6",
      "text": "Ils n’apprécieront sans doute pas d’être envoyés\\nen combat auto, alors pensez à les ménager ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_19",
      "hash64": "5EEA016A18C89A69",
      "text": "Une dernière chose, avant de conclure ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_20",
      "hash64": "5EE6826A18C58CC5",
      "text": "L’utilisation du mode combat auto repose avant\\ntout sur la relation de confiance entre un Pokémon\\r\\net son Dresseur ou sa Dresseuse.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_21",
      "hash64": "5EE6816A18C58B12",
      "text": "Donc, faites en sorte de vous montrer dignes\\ndu dévouement de vos Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_22",
      "hash64": "5EE6806A18C5895F",
      "text": "Ah, zut ! Pfff, décidément...\\nJe voulais passer à la mise en pratique !\\r\\nMais nous allons devoir nous arrêter ici...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_e_05_battle_23",
      "hash64": "5EE67F6A18C587AC",
      "text": "C’est tout pour aujourd’hui ! Je vous dis à une\\nprochaine fois ! Prenez soin de vous d’ici là ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
